<title>USA: CME to list cash-settled fresh bellies April 4.</title>
<headline>CME to list cash-settled fresh bellies April 4.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange will replace its current frozen pork belly contract with a fresh, cash-settled contract on April 4, the exchange said.</p>
<p>The current frozen contract will be listed through August 1998 on March 10, the exchange said.</p>
